# Welcome to Executed — Interactive .http Request Runner & Editor
# Click the ▶ button in the gutter to execute a request, or ✎ to open the visual Request Editor!

@baseUrl = https://httpbin.org
@apiToken = demo-secret-token-2026
@defaultAuthor = Hugo Habicht

### Get Request with Query Parameters & Custom Headers
GET {{baseUrl}}/get?environment=production&author={{defaultAuthor}}&requestId={{$uuid}}
Accept: application/json
X-Client-Name: Executed-JavaFX
X-Request-Timestamp: {{$isoTimestamp}}

### Post JSON Payload with Bearer Authentication
POST {{baseUrl}}/post
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "application": "Executed",
  "feature": "IntelliJ .http compatibility",
  "supportsInlineImages": true,
  "supportsInlinePdf": true,
  "timestamp": "{{$timestamp}}"
}

### Basic Authentication Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/basic-auth/admin/s3cret
Authorization: Basic admin s3cret
Accept: application/json

### Inspect Redirect Handling (Toggle @no-redirect via Gutter Edit)
# @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/redirect-to?url=https%3A%2F%2Fhttpbin.org%2Fget&status_code=302
Accept: application/json

### Fetch Inline PNG Image
GET {{baseUrl}}/image/png
Accept: image/png

### Fetch Inline JPEG Image
GET {{baseUrl}}/image/jpeg
Accept: image/jpeg

### Download Sample PDF Document (Displayed Inline)
GET https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf
Accept: application/pdf

### Download Binary Bytes (Automatically Saved to ./output Folder)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bytes/512
Accept: application/octet-stream
 